<%-- Left column of the sign-in and register pages (spec v3 D1): a static drawing of a locker bank with the
     three sizes, and the three things the system offers. Purely decorative, no data; colors come from app.css. --%>
<%@ page pageEncoding="UTF-8" %>
<aside class="login-aside" aria-label="Giới thiệu Smart Locker">
    <div class="login-brand">
        <span class="side-brand__mark"><svg class="ico" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="5" y="11" width="14" height="10" rx="2"/><path d="M8 11V7a4 4 0 0 1 8 0v4"/></svg></span>
        <span><span class="login-brand__name">Smart Locker</span><span class="login-brand__sub">Tủ gửi đồ thông minh trong khuôn viên</span></span>
    </div>

    <svg class="login-art" viewBox="0 0 248 228" role="img" aria-label="Hình minh họa một dãy tủ có ba cỡ ngăn S, M, L">
        <rect class="la-body" x="8" y="8" width="232" height="200" rx="10"/>
        <rect class="la-foot" x="22" y="208" width="24" height="10" rx="2"/>
        <rect class="la-foot" x="202" y="208" width="24" height="10" rx="2"/>
        <%-- column 1: S S M L --%>
        <rect class="la-door la-free" x="20" y="20" width="64" height="22" rx="4"/><text class="la-txt" x="27" y="35">S</text><rect class="la-handle" x="76" y="25" width="3" height="12" rx="1.5"/>
        <rect class="la-door la-used" x="20" y="46" width="64" height="22" rx="4"/><text class="la-txt" x="27" y="61">S</text><rect class="la-handle" x="76" y="51" width="3" height="12" rx="1.5"/>
        <rect class="la-door la-free" x="20" y="72" width="64" height="48" rx="4"/><text class="la-txt" x="27" y="88">M</text><rect class="la-handle" x="76" y="88" width="3" height="16" rx="1.5"/>
        <rect class="la-door la-free" x="20" y="124" width="64" height="74" rx="4"/><text class="la-txt" x="27" y="140">L</text><rect class="la-handle" x="76" y="151" width="3" height="20" rx="1.5"/>
        <%-- column 2 --%>
        <rect class="la-door la-used" x="92" y="20" width="64" height="22" rx="4"/><text class="la-txt" x="99" y="35">S</text><rect class="la-handle" x="148" y="25" width="3" height="12" rx="1.5"/>
        <rect class="la-door la-free" x="92" y="46" width="64" height="22" rx="4"/><text class="la-txt" x="99" y="61">S</text><rect class="la-handle" x="148" y="51" width="3" height="12" rx="1.5"/>
        <rect class="la-door la-used" x="92" y="72" width="64" height="48" rx="4"/><text class="la-txt" x="99" y="88">M</text><rect class="la-handle" x="148" y="88" width="3" height="16" rx="1.5"/>
        <rect class="la-door la-free" x="92" y="124" width="64" height="74" rx="4"/><text class="la-txt" x="99" y="140">L</text><rect class="la-handle" x="148" y="151" width="3" height="20" rx="1.5"/>
        <%-- column 3 --%>
        <rect class="la-door la-free" x="164" y="20" width="64" height="22" rx="4"/><text class="la-txt" x="171" y="35">S</text><rect class="la-handle" x="220" y="25" width="3" height="12" rx="1.5"/>
        <rect class="la-door la-free" x="164" y="46" width="64" height="22" rx="4"/><text class="la-txt" x="171" y="61">S</text><rect class="la-handle" x="220" y="51" width="3" height="12" rx="1.5"/>
        <rect class="la-door la-free" x="164" y="72" width="64" height="48" rx="4"/><text class="la-txt" x="171" y="88">M</text><rect class="la-handle" x="220" y="88" width="3" height="16" rx="1.5"/>
        <rect class="la-door la-used" x="164" y="124" width="64" height="74" rx="4"/><text class="la-txt" x="171" y="140">L</text><rect class="la-handle" x="220" y="151" width="3" height="20" rx="1.5"/>
    </svg>

    <ul class="login-points">
        <li>
            <span class="login-points__ico"><svg class="ico" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="8"/><path d="M12 7.5V12l3 2"/></svg></span>
            <span><b>Trả theo giờ và theo cỡ tủ</b><span>Ba cỡ S, M, L cho ví, laptop hay vali; giá hiện rõ trước khi đặt.</span></span>
        </li>
        <li>
            <span class="login-points__ico"><svg class="ico" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="5" y="10.5" width="14" height="9.5" rx="2"/><path d="M8 10.5V8a4 4 0 0 1 8 0v2.5"/></svg></span>
            <span><b>Mở bằng mật mã, thẻ từ hoặc vân tay</b><span>Chọn cách mở khi đặt ngăn, đổi được ở lượt sau.</span></span>
        </li>
        <li>
            <span class="login-points__ico"><svg class="ico" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 21s-6.5-6.2-6.5-11a6.5 6.5 0 0 1 13 0c0 4.8-6.5 11-6.5 11z"/><circle cx="12" cy="10" r="2.3"/></svg></span>
            <span><b>Chỉ đường tới tủ gần nhất</b><span>Sơ đồ tủ sắp các khu theo khoảng cách tới bạn.</span></span>
        </li>
    </ul>
</aside>
